# Keep server-contract fixtures byte-exact: they are captured evidence of the
# server's actual responses, and normalizing them would edit the evidence.
HealthLogTests/Fixtures/** -whitespace

# String catalogs merge by key, not by line (scripts/l10n/merge-xcstrings.py,
# docs/localization.md). Parallel branches each append keys at the end of
# "strings"; a line merge conflicts there every time. The driver itself is
# registered once per clone with `git config merge.xcstrings.driver ...`;
# without it git falls back to its normal line merge.
*.xcstrings merge=xcstrings
